      "text": "The dragon chooses one effect to impose on creatures in their inspiring presence aura.\n\nThe dragon can't use Halo Pulse again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- Repulsion Each creature must succeed at a DC 34 Fortitude save save or be pushed until it's no longer in the aura.\n\n- Restoration (healing, vitality) Each creature recovers 7d8 Hit Points."
